        "Note",
        '<strong>Devotional application.</strong> The image-of-God claim places every human — across age, ability, ethnicity, status — within the same dignity. Practically: how we treat the person in front of us is a theological act, not merely a moral one. James 3:9 makes this explicit ("we curse men, who are made in God\'s image").',
