        "Topic",
        "Topic.",
        "<strong>Topics.</strong> This verse appears under: BIRTHRIGHT, EPHRAIM, FIRSTBORN, INTERCESSION, MANASSEH, NAPHTALI, REUBEN, SIMEON, ZEBULUN. <em>[Reviewer: pick one topic (typically the first or most theologically loaded), write a 2–3 sentence thematic note, and discard the rest.]</em>",
